    {
      "subId": "1200203",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Xu at the Feiyun Commerce Guild",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "120020301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "120020301": {
            "id": "120020301",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Excuse us! We come bearing news of a matter requiring your assistance. Uh, it's all in this letter.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020302"
            ]
          },
          "120020302": {
            "id": "120020302",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Why are you suddenly talking like Xingqiu...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020303"
            ]
          },
          "120020303": {
            "id": "120020303",
            "speakerId": 1627,
            "speakerName": "Xu",
            "text": "A letter? Oh, I see... This again...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020306"
            ]
          },
          "120020306": {
            "id": "120020306",
            "speakerId": 1627,
            "speakerName": "Xu",
            "text": "Oh, don't mind me, I was just speculating. Let me give this a read.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020307"
            ]
          },
          "120020307": {
            "id": "120020307",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Can he actually read this thing? ...Is it even written in the common tongue?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020308"
            ]
          },
          "120020308": {
            "id": "120020308",
            "speakerId": 1627,
            "speakerName": "Xu",
            "text": "Hmm... Yes, this script is inimitable by the uninitiated.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020309"
            ]
          },
          "120020309": {
            "id": "120020309",
            "speakerId": 1627,
            "speakerName": "Xu",
            "text": "Honored guests, you must both be weary from your long journey. Please allow the Feiyun Commerce Guild to be your hosts for tonight."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1200202",
      "subQuestName": "Enter Liuli Pavilion",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "120020201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "120020201": {
            "id": "120020201",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Here we are at the Feiyun Commerce Guild. There sure are a lot of swanky places in Liyue Harbor!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020202"
            ]
          },
          "120020202": {
            "id": "120020202",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Let's go give them the letter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1200221",
      "subQuestName": "Talk with the servant",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "120020317"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "120020317": {
            "id": "120020317",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "And Paimon thought we'd get kicked out or turned away at the door!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020318"
            ]
          },
          "120020318": {
            "id": "120020318",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon didn't think Guhua Geek had so much clout...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020319"
            ]
          },
          "120020319": {
            "id": "120020319",
            "speakerId": 1627,
            "speakerName": "Xu",
            "text": "Thank you for your patience.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020320"
            ]
          },
          "120020320": {
            "id": "120020320",
            "speakerId": 1627,
            "speakerName": "Xu",
            "text": "With the amount of wealth and power Gentry Maocai has, it will take more than a slap on the wrist to get through to him.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020321"
            ]
          },
          "120020321": {
            "id": "120020321",
            "speakerId": 1627,
            "speakerName": "Xu",
            "text": "For him to correct the error of his ways, he must feel for himself the same suffering he has inflicted on Chang the Ninth.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020322"
            ]
          },
          "120020322": {
            "id": "120020322",
            "speakerId": 1627,
            "speakerName": "Xu",
            "text": "Since Gentry Maocai's business has to do with Cor Lapis, we simply need to buy up all the stock there is in Liyue. That will put him in a rather sticky situation.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020323"
            ]
          },
          "120020323": {
            "id": "120020323",
            "speakerId": 1627,
            "speakerName": "Xu",
            "text": "Deprived of the necessary raw materials, even the best craftsperson in Teyvat would be unable to make their product.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020324"
            ]
          },
          "120020324": {
            "id": "120020324",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Great idea! That'll be sure to mess things up between him and the Fatui.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020325"
            ]
          },
          "120020325": {
            "id": "120020325",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But... Liyue is huge. Is it really possible to buy up every last bit of Cor Lapis in the harbor?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020326"
            ]
          },
          "120020326": {
            "id": "120020326",
            "speakerId": 1627,
            "speakerName": "Xu",
            "text": "With the timescale we are on, it is indeed a challenge. Hence, as stated in the letter, we must ask for your further cooperation in the matter.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020327"
            ]
          },
          "120020327": {
            "id": "120020327",
            "speakerId": 1627,
            "speakerName": "Xu",
            "text": "First, there are a number of vendors in the city you will need to buy from. I've marked their respective locations on your map.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020328"
            ]
          },
          "120020328": {
            "id": "120020328",
            "speakerId": 1627,
            "speakerName": "Xu",
            "text": "There is also some unsold Cor Lapis at the Chasm. You will need to purchase that too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020329"
            ]
          },
          "120020329": {
            "id": "120020329",
            "speakerId": 1627,
            "speakerName": "Xu",
            "text": "Finally, there is Chang the Ninth's batch.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020330"
            ]
          },
          "120020330": {
            "id": "120020330",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Alrighty... so three sellers in the city, another one at the Chasm, and then Chang the Ninth. Roger that!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020331"
            ]
          },
          "120020331": {
            "id": "120020331",
            "speakerId": 1627,
            "speakerName": "Xu",
            "text": "Of course, we are not expecting you to cover the costs.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020332"
            ]
          },
          "120020332": {
            "id": "120020332",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wow, so many Mora! ...With cash like this, Paimon could rent out Liuli Pavilion and eat there for a whole month!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020333"
            ]
          },
          "120020333": {
            "id": "120020333",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "The Feiyun Commerce Guild is certainly generous with its resources.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020334"
            ]
          },
          "120020334": {
            "id": "120020334",
            "speakerId": 1627,
            "speakerName": "Xu",
            "text": "Heh. Well, this is not the first time we've had to do something like this. It's just par for the course now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020335"
            ]
          },
          "120020335": {
            "id": "120020335",
            "speakerId": 1627,
            "speakerName": "Xu",
            "text": "All you need to do is strike a deal. The Feiyun Commerce Guild will handle the transportation and other trifling matters.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020336"
            ]
          },
          "120020336": {
            "id": "120020336",
            "speakerId": 1627,
            "speakerName": "Xu",
            "text": "Once you have purchased all the Cor Lapis, please proceed to the Feiyun Commerce Guild's warehouse where you can see the rest of the plan unfold."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1200204",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the store and buy Cor Lapis",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "120020401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "120020401": {
            "id": "120020401",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'll take all your Cor Lapis.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020402"
            ]
          },
          "120020402": {
            "id": "120020402",
            "speakerId": 2013,
            "speakerName": "Bolai",
            "text": "All of it? Though my business may not seem so big, I should warn that I can get what you need, both legitimately and... not so legitimately. Best you give me an actual number.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020403"
            ]
          },
          "120020403": {
            "id": "120020403",
            "speakerId": 2013,
            "speakerName": "Bolai",
            "text": "All of it would be far more than you actually want.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020405",
              "120020407"
            ]
          },
          "120020405": {
            "id": "120020405",
            "speakerId": 2013,
            "speakerName": "Bolai",
            "text": "Fei— Feiyun Commerce Guild!? Well, why didn't you say so?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020408"
            ]
          },
          "120020408": {
            "id": "120020408",
            "speakerId": 2013,
            "speakerName": "Bolai",
            "text": "If it's for the Feiyun Commerce Guild, then sign on the dotted line, and I'll start getting things in order right away!"
          },
          "120020407": {
            "id": "120020407",
            "speakerId": 2013,
            "speakerName": "Bolai",
            "text": "What are you saying? Of course my business is all above board. Feiyun Commerce Guild, you say... Hmm."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1200205",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the store and buy Cor Lapis",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "120020501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "120020501": {
            "id": "120020501",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'll take all your Cor Lapis.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020502"
            ]
          },
          "120020502": {
            "id": "120020502",
            "speakerId": 2090,
            "speakerName": "Changshun",
            "text": "You want ALL my Cor Lapis? Ahh, I've already agreed to several orders.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020503"
            ]
          },
          "120020503": {
            "id": "120020503",
            "speakerId": 2090,
            "speakerName": "Changshun",
            "text": "That said, none are in writing. The buyers are being incredibly indecisive.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020504"
            ]
          },
          "120020504": {
            "id": "120020504",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Then let the Feiyun Commerce Guild take it off your hands.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020505"
            ]
          },
          "120020505": {
            "id": "120020505",
            "speakerId": 2090,
            "speakerName": "Changshun",
            "text": "Oh, it's for the Feiyun Commerce Guild? Hmm, seems business trends are about to change in Liyue...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020506"
            ]
          },
          "120020506": {
            "id": "120020506",
            "speakerId": 2090,
            "speakerName": "Changshun",
            "text": "Oh, ahh... nothing. Just talking to myself. Come, let us sign a contract.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020507"
            ]
          },
          "120020507": {
            "id": "120020507",
            "speakerId": 2090,
            "speakerName": "Changshun",
            "text": "Don't worry about my prior client, he hadn't made any down payments or anything. Quite common in the industry.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020508"
            ]
          },
          "120020508": {
            "id": "120020508",
            "speakerId": 2090,
            "speakerName": "Changshun",
            "text": "Thank you for your patronage, we hope the Feiyun Commerce Guild will continue to do business with us!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1200206",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the store and buy Cor Lapis",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "120020601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "120020601": {
            "id": "120020601",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Are you out of Cor Lapis too?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020602"
            ]
          },
          "120020602": {
            "id": "120020602",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Oh, I thought you were here to purchase Snezhnayan products.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020603"
            ]
          },
          "120020603": {
            "id": "120020603",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "No, that I still have, although I ship it all to factories in Snezhnaya. I don't do retail.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020604"
            ]
          },
          "120020604": {
            "id": "120020604",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Too much hassle, not enough return. Sorry.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020607"
            ]
          },
          "120020607": {
            "id": "120020607",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "Wha— Ah, no, no, no. Give me a second to think. Um...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020608"
            ]
          },
          "120020608": {
            "id": "120020608",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "A—Alright, I'll do it. Just need you to sign for it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120020609"
            ]
          },
          "120020609": {
            "id": "120020609",
            "speakerId": 2072,
            "speakerName": "Ivanovich",
            "text": "(Clearly no shortage of cashflow in Liyue...)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
